                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِنْتَوَى القَوْمُ مَنْزِلًا بِمَوْضِعِ كَذَا</span></b> 
                         (S, Msb) <i>The
people,</i> or <i>party, repaired,</i> or <i>betook themselves,
to,</i> or <i>towards, a place of alighting</i> or <i>abode,
in such a place.</i> (Msb.) See 1. ― 
